            "key": "features-title-en",
            "text": "Why Choose Kay's?"
        },
        {
            "key": "features-title-zh",
            "text": "为什么选择Kay's？"
        },
        {
            "key": "story-en-1",
            "text": "Kay, known fondly as \"Kay Jie\" among her friends, was born in Xi'an, China. A passionate food lover and spice enthusiast, she began her culinary journey in Shenzhen, where she mastered the art of balancing flavors and heat. Bringing together the essence of both Northern and Southern Chinese chili traditions, Kay created her own signature chili sauce recipe — one that quickly gained admiration from friends and diners alike."
        },
        {
            "key": "story-en-2",
            "text": "In 2013, Kay immigrated to North America, bringing her love of bold flavors across the ocean. Her homemade chili sauce soon became a bridge of friendship — a taste of home that connected people through shared meals and stories."
        },
        {
            "key": "story-en-3",
            "text": "During her time running a restaurant in Virginia, Kay's chili sauce became a sensation. It was so popular that customers often asked for jars to take home, and even years after Kay sold her restaurant during the pandemic, people continued to reach out, hoping to get another taste."
        },
        {
            "key": "story-en-4",
            "text": "To honor that passion and bring authentic heat to those who love spice as much as she does, Kay founded her own food company. Her chili sauce became the first product — and the first premium chili sauce cooked entirely with avocado oil on the market."
        },
        {
            "key": "story-en-5",
            "text": "Today, Kay Chili Sauce carries the warmth of friendship, the richness of tradition, and the joy of real flavor — crafted for those who simply can't live without spice."
        },
        {
            "key": "story-zh-1",
            "text": "Kay（朋友们亲切地称她为\"Kay姐\"）出生于中国西安，成名于深圳。她不仅是一位美食探索家，还是位热情的画家，同时也是大华府地区活跃的中国京剧演员。她的画室是色彩的天堂，她对大自然的热爱以及对世界各地美食的独到见解，直接启发了她的私人菜单。她用艺术家的视角看待美食，将视觉审美、传统文化与深厚风味天衣无缝地融为一体。"
        },
        {
            "key": "story-zh-2",
            "text": "2013年，Kay将她的招牌辣椒酱配方带到了北美。在弗吉尼亚州经营风靡一时的餐厅期间，她的自制辣椒酱成了当时的爆款，食客们甚至经常要求打包整罐带回家。即使在疫情期间餐厅关闭多年后，忠实的顾客们依然不断联系她，只为能再次尝到那一口让人魂牵梦绕的味道。"
        },
        {
            "key": "story-zh-3",
            "text": "为了回应这份执着的期盼，Kay创立了自己的食品公司。Kay's Special Chili Oil Sauce 作为她的明星旗舰产品，是市面上第一款完全使用 100% 牛油果油和新鲜原料烹制的顶级辣椒酱。"
        },
        {
            "key": "story-zh-4",
            "text": "Kay 将中国辣椒传统的浓郁精髓与她独特的艺术灵魂注入其中，为所有真正无辣不欢的人，带去友情的温度、文化的厚度以及最纯正的家乡味道。"
        },
        {
            "key": "feedback-intro-en",
            "text": "See how our customers enjoy Kay's Special Chili Oil Sauce with their favorite dishes!"
        },
        {
            "key": "feedback-intro-zh",
            "text": "看看我们的客户如何用Kay's特制辣椒油搭配他们最喜欢的菜肴！"
        },
        {
            "key": "feedback-1-caption-en",
            "text": "\"Perfect with dumplings!\""
        },
        {
            "key": "feedback-1-caption-zh",
            "text": "\"搭配饺子太完美了！\""
        },
        {
            "key": "feedback-2-caption-en",
            "text": "\"Best chili oil I've ever had\""
        },
        {
            "key": "feedback-2-caption-zh",
            "text": "\"我吃过最好的辣椒油\""
        },
        {
            "key": "feedback-3-caption-en",
            "text": "\"Reminds me of home\""
        },
        {
            "key": "feedback-3-caption-zh",
            "text": "\"让我想起家的味道\""
        },
        {
